      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      79.39,
      116.7,
      516.26,
      132.44
    ],
    "text": "Finding that the decree was not served on the defendant the court made an order for the",
