      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      79.73,
      137.57,
      516.94,
      153.31
    ],
    "text": "plaintiff to apply for writ after serving the decree on the defendant. This order was made",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      79.83,
      157.96,
      519.5,
      173.71
    ],
    "text": "on 3.9.2003. On 3.11.2004 the defendant moved court inter alia for an order of",
