      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      80.28,
      178.84,
      517.45,
      194.59
    ],
    "text": "abatement of the plaintiffs action under section 402 of the Civil Procedure Code. The",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      80.29,
      199.49,
      517.88,
      215.24
    ],
    "text": "court after an inquiry, by order dated 14.12.2005 refused to abate the plaintiffs case with",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      80.75,
      220.09,
      384.8,
      236.03
    ],
    "text": "costs. It is this order the defendant is seeking to have set aside.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.12520980834961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      81.01,
      261.65,
      515.34,
      277.39
    ],
    "text": "The learned President's Counsel for the defendant submitted that the moment the ex-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      80.3,
      282.76,
      518.06,
      298.51
    ],
    "text": "parte trial was concluded a duty was cast on the plaintiff under section 85 (4) of the CPC",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.575922966003418,
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      81.33,
      303.17,
      436.24,
      318.91
    ],
    "text": "to have the decree served on the defendant. Sub section (4) is as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      153.91,
      344.44,
      494.15,
      387.79
    ],
    "text": "85 (4): The court shall cause a copy of the decree entered under this section to be served on the defendant in the manner prescribed for the service of summons ...",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.575922966003418,
      11.800000190734863,
      11.844964027404785,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      82.22,
      406.6,
      519.58,
      422.35
    ],
    "text": "The learned counsel submitted that serving the decree is mandatory. The court does the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      82.87,
      427.49,
      519.82,
      443.24
    ],
    "text": "serving. However it has to be at the instance of the plaintiff. The learned counsel",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.154815673828125
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      83.1,
      447.88,
      519.65,
      463.63
    ],
    "text": "submitted that the phrase \"the court shall cause a copy to be served\" means that it has to",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      83.28,
      469.0,
      520.43,
      484.75
    ],
    "text": "be at the instance of the plaintiff and where the court is obliged to take a step and does",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.740449905395508,
      11.755014419555664,
      11.800000190734863,
      12.422006607055664
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      83.26,
      489.88,
      520.43,
      505.63
    ],
    "text": "not take it and the plaintiff also does not move on the matter for a period of one year the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      83.55,
      511.01,
      520.56,
      526.75
    ],
    "text": "plaintiff is bound to suffer. The learned counsel relied on the judgment in Samsudeen vs",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      83.68,
      531.88,
      523.01,
      547.63
    ],
    "text": "Eagle Insurance Co. Ltd., (64 N.L.R. 372) where Tambiah J held that an order of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.154815673828125
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      83.88,
      552.52,
      520.85,
      568.27
    ],
    "text": "abatement could be made under section 402 of the CPC \"only if the plaintiff has failed to",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863,
      12.28911304473877,
      12.407654762268066
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      83.96,
      573.16,
      291.76,
      588.91
    ],
    "text": "take a step rendered necessary by the law\"",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      84.4,
      614.2,
      521.61,
      629.95
    ],
    "text": "In this case Tambiah J considered a long line of cases. The first case to be considered was",
