    "bbox": [
      76.03,
      74.67,
      513.77,
      90.14
    ],
    "text": "Banda vs. Hendirick \u00ab(1911) 6 Weerakoon Reports 42) where Lascelles CJ held that the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
