  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      78.21,
      261.09,
      220.25,
      277.23
    ],
    "text": "the CPC\"( emphasis added).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727,
      11.74059772491455,
      12.100000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      78.38,
      303.13,
      515.9,
      318.61
    ],
    "text": "Tambiah J also considered the judgment in Suppramaniam vs. Symons (supra) and",
